# Employment-site apply loop

1. Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
2. Read [`.agents/skills/candidate-source.md`](../../.agents/skills/candidate-source.md) and the current `resume.tex`.
3. Follow [`.agents/skills/job-apply-loop/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/job-apply-loop/SKILL.md).
4. Login page: pause for user takeover in the dedicated browser; if unresolved, block that site and rotate without closing tabs.
5. Never submit without explicit OK for that job.
6. After one successful submission, ask whether to continue on the same site or move to another.
